            "review_text": "Alex D\nHanoi, Vietnam666 contributions\n0\nWe got food poisoning\nAug 2018\nThe taste was average, nothing special and very salty even though we had asked them to have less salt. We ordered stir fried morning glory but it did not look like the menu. When we finished half of the dish we found a long plastic string on it. We told the waiter to inform the kitchen to be more careful. Few minutes later we found another one and we made a complaint to the manager. No apologies was made she just asked if we would like to get another one and we all said no. We also ordered a hot pot but the food was not fresh, the portion was very small for 4 persons. We all got stomach upset after few hours having dinner there.\nRead more\nWritten August 3, 2018",
