            "review_text": "Pham Thu Hien ( Nicole)\nHanoi, Vietnam576 contributions\n0\nFresh, Laos style taste, Good service !\nFeb 2018 • Friends\nIf you are seeking for Laos food in Hanoi, you can vísit any Khao Lao restaurant in some big shopping mall in Hanoi as: Vincom Pham Ngoc Thach, Nguyen Chi Thanh, .......\nThe decoration style here is set as Laos style with some detail which remind us abou Laos. The uniform of well come staff is Laos Style. \nThe food here is fresh, the taste quite similar to Original Laos Taste. Hope that their cuisine Consultive expert can keep and renovate current recipes. \nThe typical dishes here is \" Lap \" with fish \"lap\", chicken \"lap\", ........( the sauce made with Laos Style). \nI tried fish soup ( sour and spicy). This soup has a balance taste: not too sour, spicy and oily . \nTofu is crunchy outside, soft and creamy inside. \nService here is good and fast. Although sometimes has mis-commumication between clients and waiters. \nRecommend for Laos food lovers.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 23, 2018",
